    "scenesThatPass": [
      "LOTO: New canoe, how’d she hold up? Lay it on me.\nMOANA: I mean, it takes a bit to rotate the sail, but -\nLOTO: Got it!\nMOANA: No no no. Loto, you don’t-",
      "SIMEA: Biiiiig Sissss!\nMOANA: I am honored to serve our people. May the ancestors continue to guide us.",
      "SINA: Moana!\nMOANA: Motufetū, the island I have to find is Motufetū.",
      "MOANA: IF I’M NOT HERE TO HOLD HER HAND... WILL SHE GROW TO UNDERSTAND?\nMOANA: Gramma!\nGRAMMA TALA: I’LL ALWAYS BE RIGHT BESIDE YOU... BUT PERHAPS YOU’RE MEANT FOR MORE..",
      "GRAMMA TALA: Oh, what are you so worried about?\nMOANA: It’s not like last time.\nGRAMMA TALA: Last time you weren’t old enough to understand all you could lose... or learn. But here we are... together still... just a little different.…\nGRAMMA TALA: I can’t see where your story leads... but we never stop choosing who we are."
    ]
